<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Johnston School District, Iowa.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Johnston School District, Iowa.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday it qualified for bond insurance Johnston Community School District, Iowa's $3.75 million general obligation school bond issue.</p>
<p>The deal is set to sell by competitive bids at 1500 EST.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
